select 'work-energy', 'Conservation of energy: First law of thermodynamics', 'If an open system (in which mass may be exchanged with the environment) has several walls such that the mass transfer is through rigid walls separate from the heat and work transfers, then the first law may be written as', 'Wikipedia: Conservation of energy', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Conservation_of_energy&oldid=1376926775', 'CC BY-SA 4.0. Wikipedia contributors (see page history). Excerpted and split into passages.'
